  <running_head>EVANGELI. SECULI. IV.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>quod</catchword>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="2" para="true">III. Lib. 3. Regum cap. II. scribitur</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="2">de Salomone: <i>averterunt mulieres cor ejus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>&amp;c.</i> quæ sequuntur.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">Vult Jesuita cum</l>
    <l n="5">Bellarmino &amp; aliis, Salomonem Regem</l>
    <l n="6">fidem iustificantem &amp; Spiritum san-</l>
    <l n="7">ctum amisisse in eo, quod factus sit id-</l>
    <l n="8">olatra &amp; insignis peccator. Id qui-</l>
    <l n="9">dem ego de homine, qui typum Chri-</l>
    <l n="10">sti gessit, propheta Dei fuit, &amp; libros</l>
    <l n="11">canonicos scripsit non ausim affirmare.</l>
    <l n="12">Præcipuè cum Deus per prophetam</l>
    <l n="13">Nathanem de Salomone locutus sit:</l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>Ego ero illi Pater &amp; ipse erit mihi filius,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>qui cum perverse egerit, ego corripiam eum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>virgâ hominum &amp; plagis humanis: &amp; be-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>nignitas mea non amovebitur ab eo.</i> Fuit</l>
    <l n="18">itaque Salomon ad tempus emansor,</l>
    <l n="19">sed non defertor. Quanquam itaque</l>
    <l n="20">cum Hieronymo dicendum, <i>Salomo-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>nem divitijs confisum per mulieres of-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>fendisse Deum,</i> ab eo tamen spiritum</l>
    <l n="23">sanctum totaliter sublatum esse supe-</l>
    <l n="24">rius vaticinium non permittit. Ob-</l>
    <l n="25">servandum itaque in hac controversia</l>
    <l n="26">quod</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes />
